es.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/77-of-us-voters-fear-ai-election-manipulation-why-deepfakes-are-raising-alarm-ahead-of-2026-midterms/articleshow/135510321.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T00:31:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135510709,imgsize-67879.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump celebrates early Republican gains in Guam, says ‘hopefully that’s an indication’ for US midterms]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135510561.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/trump-celebrates-early-republican-gains-in-guam-says-hopefully-thats-an-indication-for-us-midterms/articleshow/135510561.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/trump-celebrates-early-republican-gains-in-guam-says-hopefully-thats-an-indication-for-us-midterms/articleshow/135510561.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T00:10:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135510817,imgsize-56432.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Arkansas man loses tax offset bid as court upholds ex-wife's $183,000 business share]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135492388.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Following their divorce in 2017, a couple in Arkansas found themselves embroiled in a lengthy legal dispute concerning their jointly owned business, Groundskeeper. Conflicts emerged regarding the business's valuation and tax obligations. The Arkansas Court of Appeals confirmed the wife's claim of $183,000, inclusive of prejudgment interest from the divorce date, mandating Craig Ballegeer to acquire his former wife's half-interest in the business.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-arkansas-couple-divorced-after-34-years-of-marriage-then-fought-four-appeals-over-their-business-a-court-upheld-the-wifes-183000-half-share-and-interest-from-2017-rejecting-the-husbands-tax-offset/articleshow/135492388.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-arkansas-couple-divorced-after-34-years-of-marriage-then-fought-four-appeals-over-their-business-a-court-upheld-the-wifes-183000-half-share-and-interest-from-2017-rejecting-the-husbands-tax-offset/articleshow/135492388.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T01:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135492556,imgsize-1662592.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Discarded Nets Become Hoops: Giannis foundation, Enaleia upcycle gear; 80 Athens courts benefit]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135482286.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a remarkable initiative, the Charles Antetokounmpo Family Foundation and Enaleia have repurposed discarded fishing gear into vibrant basketball nets, enhancing public courts across Athens. This project not only replaces damaged nets but also tackles marine pollution by transforming waste into valuable resources for the community. Young athletes can engage with these recycled nets, fostering a sense of environmental awareness alongside their love for sports.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/giannis-antetokounmpos-family-foundation-teamed-up-with-a-marine-cleanup-group-in-2026-transforming-discarded-fishing-gear-into-basketball-nets-for-public-courts-across-athens-and-replacing-80-worn-nets/articleshow/135482286.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/giannis-antetokounmpos-family-foundation-teamed-up-with-a-marine-cleanup-group-in-2026-transforming-discarded-fishing-gear-into-basketball-nets-for-public-courts-across-athens-and-replacing-80-worn-nets/articleshow/135482286.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T01:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135482374,imgsize-1720874.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Purple 1888 Victorian house in LA listed for $2M]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135492794.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Listed at $2 million, the unique Esperanza House embodies 138 years of history as a Queen Anne Victorian masterpiece with a bold purple exterior. Previously owned by Leonora Pierotti Thomas, the house is rich in artistic character yet demands extensive restoration. Nonetheless, essential features like the pool remain functional, and the agent appeals to buyers keen on its historic value and future possibilities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-los-angeles-artist-bought-an-1888-victorian-house-in-1979-and-turned-it-purple-inside-and-out-now-the-estate-is-on-the-market-asking-2-million-for-the-four-bedroom-property-with-restoration-estimated-to-cost-at-least-1-million/articleshow/135492794.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-los-angeles-artist-bought-an-1888-victorian-house-in-1979-and-turned-it-purple-inside-and-out-now-the-estate-is-on-the-market-asking-2-million-for-the-four-bedroom-property-with-restoration-estimated-to-cost-at-least-1-million/articleshow/135492794.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T00:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135492990,imgsize-321464.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Georgia company loses appeal over $220,000 tax auction purchase as county claims sovereign immunity]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135489294.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Talon Assets, LLC acquired land in Atlanta for $220,000 at a county tax sale. Doubts about the property led them to request a refund and tax deed cancellation. However, Fulton County dismissed their case, invoking sovereign immunity as a legal defense. The Georgia Court of Appeals upheld this dismissal, leaving Talon's issues unresolved. This ruling highlights the challenges in pursuing financial claims against county governments in Georgia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-georgia-company-paid-220000-at-a-tax-auction-for-an-atlanta-parcel-it-says-does-not-exist-after-demanding-its-money-back-it-lost-an-october-30-appeal-because-the-county-was-protected-by-sovereign-immunity/articleshow/135489294.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-georgia-company-paid-220000-at-a-tax-auction-for-an-atlanta-parcel-it-says-does-not-exist-after-demanding-its-money-back-it-lost-an-october-30-appeal-because-the-county-was-protected-by-sovereign-immunity/articleshow/135489294.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T23:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135489449,imgsize-2002734.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Texas farmers turn 640 acres of donated land into college scholarships for 300 students]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135490407.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 640-acre farmland donation made to a Texas school district in 1984 has become a source of college scholarships for hundreds of students. Local farmers in Gruver volunteer their labour and equipment to grow crops, generating approximately $400,000 annually. Since 2016, the initiative has distributed nearly $3 million to around 300 students, helping them pursue higher education.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1984-a-texas-school-district-received-640-acres-of-farmland-decades-later-volunteer-farmers-are-using-its-harvests-to-raise-about-400000-a-year-for-college-scholarships-helping-around-300-students/articleshow/135490407.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1984-a-texas-school-district-received-640-acres-of-farmland-decades-later-volunteer-farmers-are-using-its-harvests-to-raise-about-400000-a-year-for-college-scholarships-helping-around-300-students/articleshow/135490407.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T23:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135491222,imgsize-111096.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Melania Trump to host Russia, Ukraine officials at White House over Oleshky ceasefire]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135509258.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/melania-trump-to-host-russia-ukraine-officials-at-white-house-over-oleshky-ceasefire/articleshow/135509258.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/melania-trump-to-host-russia-ukraine-officials-at-white-house-over-oleshky-ceasefire/articleshow/13